Please note that some assertions like `Debug.Assert(New_Ret == Old_arrListCount);` are not entirely correct, because `New_Ret` is the status (boolean) of whether x is in the list or not, not the actual position of x in the list, which is what `New_arrListIndexOfX` represents.

